Michał SchliskeSenior Project Manager

Apply for this position

BlueSoft is an innovative Software House and a part of the Orange Group. For over 20 years, we have been delivering projects in software engineering, cloud, data, and system integration for leading organizations in Poland and abroad. We also develop our own SaaS products, which we commercialize and scale on local and international markets.
Project description
• the project focuses on driving business transformation through the implementation of AI-powered pricing solutions and enhancing data readiness across a global organisation;
• the goal is to ensure that AI and analytics solutions deliver measurable business value and can be successfully scaled across multiple countries and business units.

Your responsibilities
• gather and analyse business requirements and facilitate stakeholder workshops;
• prepare business and functional documentation, user stories, business rules and acceptance criteria;
• support the definition and implementation of AI use cases within Pricing;
• coordinate data quality, data validation and data readiness activities;
• collaborate with business, Data, BI, AI and IT teams;
• plan and coordinate User Acceptance Testing (UAT), defect management and release readiness;
• track project progress, risks, dependencies and business outcomes;
• support user adoption, training and continuous improvement.
What we expect
• typically 8+ years of relevant experience in business analysis, Data & Analytics or technology transformation;
• strong business analysis, requirements gathering and process mapping skills;
• proven experience producing functional specifications, user stories and acceptance criteria;
• hands-on experience planning and leading UAT activities;
• good understanding of Data Quality, Data Readiness and BI solutions;
• practical understanding of AI and analytics delivery lifecycles;
• experience working with international business and technical stakeholders;
• proficiency in Jira, Confluence, Excel or equivalent tools;
• professional proficiency in Polish and English.
Nice to Have
• SQL skills and experience with BI tools such as Power BI or Tableau;
• experience in Pricing, Finance or Commercial Analytics; 
• exposure to AI Transformation, Data Governance or Data Migration projects;
• familiarity with process modelling tools such as Visio, Miro or Mural.
What you gain by collaborating with BlueSoft
👨‍💻 Collaboration with an interdisciplinary team of technology experts who value direct communication and partnership.
📈 Long-term project engagement with a company that has been growing in the IT market for over 20 years.
🚀 Participation in diverse IT initiatives delivered for recognised clients and industry leaders.
🥇 Access to modern technologies and an environment based on high engineering standards.
⌚️ Flexible service delivery model — hybrid or fully remote, depending on the project.
☁ Knowledge-sharing and development ecosystem, including internal training, tech guilds and Cloud training and certifications.
📣 Access to online English or German learning and group language classes.
