 Join Our Team: Junior eCommerce Developer Wanted!

 Are you a developer looking to get into the world of eCommerce? Do you want to build slick, super fast online stores that make customers go “Wow”? If so, you might just be the one for us at Envisage Digital!

 Who We Are.

 We’re a UK based eCommerce agency, specialising in Magento, Shopify, BigCommerce and more. We build online stores that don’t just look good – they perform well.
Now we’re looking for a Junior Developer to help us take our clients’ sites to the next level. If you’re keen, curious and love solving problems with code, let’s talk!

 What You’ll Be Doing.

• Building and customising next gen eCommerce websites.
• Fixing bugs and turning glitches into features.
• Working with our team of designers, developers and project managers.
• Learning the ins and outs of platforms like Magento, Hyvä and Shopify (don’t worry, we’ll show you the way!).
• Keeping up to date with the latest eCommerce trends and technologies – because we like to be ahead of the curve.

 What We’re Looking For.

 • Love to code—HTML, CSS, PHP and JavaScript are your thing.
• Basic knowledge of eCommerce platforms (Magento knowledge is a big plus!).
• Problem solving mentality and a desire to learn.
