JOB RESPONSIBILITIES
• Account Management: Oversee and manage financial accounts for our clients, including ecommerce account setup, business operations consulting, market research, financial analysis, and strategic planning.

• Financial Reporting: Prepare and analyse financial statements, reports, and budgets to provide clients with valuable insights into their financial performance.

• Client Relations: Maintain strong relationships with clients, serving as their primary point of contact for financial matters and addressing their inquiries and concerns.

• Compliance: Ensure that all financial transactions and reporting comply with relevant regulations and industry standards.

• Forecasting: Assist clients in forecasting financial trends and identifying opportunities for growth and cost savings.

• Team Collaboration: Collaborate with cross-functional teams to integrate financial data and insights into strategic planning and decision-making processes.

• Problem Solving: Identify financial issues or discrepancies and implement corrective actions as needed.

QUALIFICATION
• Bachelor's degree in Finance, Accounting, or a related field.

• Proven experience in financial management, accounting, or related roles.

• Knowledge of financial software and tools.

SKILLS
• Strong analytical and numerical skills.

• Attention to detail and accuracy in financial reporting.

• Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.

• Proficiency in financial software and Microsoft Excel.

• Ability to work independently and meet deadlines.

HOW TO APPLY- 
If you are a proactive and results-driven individual with a passion for financial management, please submit your resume and a cover letter highlighting your qualifications and relevant experience to info@justneatservices.com. Please include "Accounts Manager Application" in the subject line of your email.

APPLICATION - Open

Apply Now

Business Sales Executive

London, UK

Job Type

Full Time

Workspace

On Site

Apply Now

About the Role

We are looking for a highly motivated and dynamic Business Sales Executive to join our team at a leading business solutions and services providing company. As a Business Sales Executive, you will be the driving force behind our growth, responsible for identifying and cultivating new business opportunities, forging lasting client relationships, and promoting our suite of services, including ecommerce account setup, business operations consulting, market research, financial analysis, and strategic planning. If you are a results-oriented sales professional with a passion for helping businesses succeed, we invite you to apply.

Requirements

