JOB RESPONSIBILITIES
1. Business Development: Identify and engage prospective clients, building and nurturing a robust sales pipeline.
2. Client Engagement: Conduct consultations and presentations to understand client needs, propose tailored solutions, and effectively communicate the value of our services.
3. Sales Strategy: Develop and execute sales strategies to achieve revenue targets and meet business objectives.
4. Relationship Building: Establish and maintain strong, long-term relationships with clients, becoming a trusted advisor in their business growth journey.
5. Market Insights: Stay informed about industry trends, competitor offerings, and market dynamics to adapt sales strategies accordingly.
6. Sales Reporting: Maintain accurate records of sales activities and provide regular reports on progress to management.
7. Team Collaboration: Collaborate with internal teams to ensure seamless service delivery and client satisfaction.

QUALIFICATION
1. Bachelor's degree in Business, Marketing, or a related field.
2. Proven track record of successful sales experience, preferably in B2B sales.
3. Strong understanding of business solutions and services.

SKILLS
1. Excellent communication and presentation skills.
2. Strong negotiation and persuasion abilities.
3. Self-motivated and target-driven.
4. Proficiency in CRM software and sales tools.
5. Ability to work independently and as part of a team.

HOW TO APPLY
 If you are a goal-oriented sales professional with a passion for helping businesses thrive, please submit your resume and a cover letter outlining your qualifications and relevant experience to info@justneatservices.com. Please include "Business Sales Executive Application" in the subject line of your email.

APPLICATION - Open

Apply Now

Web Designer

London, UK

Job Type

Full Time

Workspace

On-Site

Apply Now

About the Role

Justneat Services Ltd is seeking a Web Designer to join our dynamic team. In this role, you will be the vital link between our clients and our web development services, ensuring their needs are met and exceeded. You will also be responsible for crafting visually appealing designs and managing social media accounts for our clients.

